- Never secretly record or secretly upload audio or video.
- Make recording, saving, uploading, and sharing distinct user-visible actions.
- Handle denied permissions, interrupted recordings, low storage, and failed uploads.
- Preserve useful timestamps and metadata where available without inventing them.
- Provide an accessible way to stop recording.
- Review relevant legal, consent, and platform restrictions before release in each target region.

