Implement reasonable mitigations, document residual risks, and create a security checklist for release.

Use secure transport, least privilege, secret management, server-side validation, and supported platform protections.

Do not claim that encryption, deletion, backup, or access revocation is complete unless it has actually been implemented and verified. Explain the limitations of revocation for data already delivered to another person or downloaded outside the app.

